{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637060/extras/HISTORY.png?t=1745233217\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This time, Jack and Jill find themselves in a state overwhelmed by neglect and disrepair! When scrap metal clogs the streets and polluted springs threaten wildlife, a bold gubernatorial candidate named Sophia volunteers to attempt to transform despair into hope\u2014but she\u2019s not alone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637060/extras/Banner_1.png?t=1745233217\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Jack, Jill, and Sophia as you journey through beautifully crafted landscapes, clear debris from abandoned roads, repair railroads, and restore neglected parks. Every task is a stepping stone towards a brighter future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637060/extras/Banner_2.png?t=1745233217\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, you\u2019ll meet a quirky cast of characters and find yourself facing off against corrupt officials and crafty bandits. Do you have what it takes to clean up the state, restore nature\u2019s beauty, and win the hearts of the people? Download and play today to ignite a revolution of hope and rebuild a community that\u2019s been forgotten and ignored for too long!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637060/extras/Banner_3.png?t=1745233217\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637060/extras/Gameplay.png?t=1745233217\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Golden Rails: The heart of the state, as in any time manager you have to accurately calculate the time for building, collecting resources and timely use of bonuses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has a large variety of buildings and unique items, collecting them you will perform tasks and participate in unique adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637060/extras/Banner_4.png?t=1745233217\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">60 exciting levels + 6 levels with mini-games </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step-by-step level guide </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catchy downloadable Original Soundtrack </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful desktop wallpapers </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">60 collectible owls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decoration pieces for the owl in \u201cWanted\u201d section   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock improvements and add bonuses to the level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn dozens of achievements </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3637060?t=1745233217","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637060/b2ffd5ace62daa04159691416cc05b925d1bb4b0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745233217","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637060/e88e4f31c6adb7e5ab94b7af4966a73893c2d9dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745233217","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637060/e88e4f31c6adb7e5ab94b7af4966a73893c2d9dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745233217","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637060/extras/HISTORY.png?t=1745233217\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This time, Jack and Jill find themselves in a state overwhelmed by neglect and disrepair! When scrap metal clogs the streets and polluted springs threaten wildlife, a bold gubernatorial candidate named Sophia volunteers to attempt to transform despair into hope\u2014but she\u2019s not alone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637060/extras/Banner_1.png?t=1745233217\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Jack, Jill, and Sophia as you journey through beautifully crafted landscapes, clear debris from abandoned roads, repair railroads, and restore neglected parks. Every task is a stepping stone towards a brighter future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637060/extras/Banner_2.png?t=1745233217\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, you\u2019ll meet a quirky cast of characters and find yourself facing off against corrupt officials and crafty bandits. Do you have what it takes to clean up the state, restore nature\u2019s beauty, and win the hearts of the people? Download and play today to ignite a revolution of hope and rebuild a community that\u2019s been forgotten and ignored for too long!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637060/extras/Banner_3.png?t=1745233217\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637060/extras/Gameplay.png?t=1745233217\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Golden Rails: The heart of the state, as in any time manager you have to accurately calculate the time for building, collecting resources and timely use of bonuses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has a large variety of buildings and unique items, collecting them you will perform tasks and participate in unique adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637060/extras/Banner_4.png?t=1745233217\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">60 exciting levels + 6 levels with mini-games </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step-by-step level guide </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catchy downloadable Original Soundtrack </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful desktop wallpapers </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">60 collectible owls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decoration pieces for the owl in \u201cWanted\u201d section   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock improvements and add bonuses to the level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn dozens of achievements </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Alawar Casual"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637060/b02d92bb328c41f11a376b1533f2f16680145144/header.jpg?t=1745233217","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257121718,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121718/movie480.mp4?t=1744877853","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121718/movie_max.mp4?t=1744877853"},"name":"Golden Rails 7 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257121718/f20155ab0a82773a4b1e001aa5a882a9ff9e5b4d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744877853","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121718/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744877853","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121718/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744877853"}}],"name":"Golden Rails: The heart of the state","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><str